-- CONCURSO PÚBLICO APLICAÇÃO: 2021, banca CEBRASPE). This is Cargo 4, the
-- final cargo of the same concurso already imported for Agente
-- (20260926050000/20260927080000), Delegado (20260929240000) and Escrivão
-- (20260929250000).
--
-- Source material read verbatim from Google Drive this session:
--   - Prova: CARGO_4_PAPILOSCOPISTA_POLICIAL_FEDERAL.pdf (fileId
--     1KbXyqwbK3-g27fCgxmQ2gzeJ7-DONF7v) - full 120-item CEBRASPE
--     Certo/Errado objective test, cover states "CARGO 4_PAPILOSCOPISTA
--     POLICIAL FEDERAL"; read fully in this session (not just the
--     papiloscopia block).
--   - Gabarito: GAB_DEFINITIVO_PPF.PDF (fileId
--     1a4uF_zzQnp4ijZupXQen_H0BIY9a9aZB) - explicitly labeled
--     "CARGO: PAPILOSCOPISTA POLICIAL FEDERAL", Matriz_577_PF_004_00.
